{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106407","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106407/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106407/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106407/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106407","id":3063945550,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6WNQM4","number":106407,"title":"Rework semaphores for presentation to be created per swap chain image to fix validation error.","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-05-14T18:26:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T15:30:10Z","closed_at":"2025-05-15T15:29:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106407","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106407","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106407.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106407.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-15T15:29:33Z"},"body":"This fixes an unreported error that shows up on newer versions of the VulkanSDK.\r\n\r\n```\r\nValidation Error: [ VUID-vkQueueSubmit-pSignalSemaphores-00067 ] | MessageID = 0x539277af\r\nvkQueueSubmit(): pSubmits[0].pSignalSemaphores[0] (VkSemaphore 0x65b000000065b) is being signaled by VkQueue 0x1ac042f0580, but it may still be in use by VkSwapchainKHR 0x6470000000647.\r\nHere are the most recently acquired image indices: 0, [0], 1, 1.\r\n(brackets mark the last use of VkSemaphore 0x65b000000065b in a presentation operation)\r\nSwapchain image 0 was presented but was not re-acquired, so VkSemaphore 0x65b000000065b may still be in use and cannot be safely reused with image index 1.\r\nVulkan insight: One solution is to assign each image its own semaphore. This also handles the case where vkAcquireNextImageKHR returns the same index twice in a row. Here are some common methods to ensure that a semaphore passed to vkQueuePresentKHR is not in use and can be safely reused:\r\n        a) Use a separate semaphore per swapchain image. Index these semaphores using the index of the acquired image.\r\n        b) Consider the VK_EXT_swapchain_maintenance1 extension. It allows using a VkFence with the presentation operation.\r\nThe Vulkan spec states: Each binary semaphore element of the pSignalSemaphores member of any element of pSubmits must be unsignaled when the semaphore signal operation it defines is executed on the device (https://vulkan.lunarg.com/doc/view/1.4.313.0/windows/antora/spec/latestchapters/cmdbuffers.html#VUID-vkQueueSubmit-pSignalSemaphores-00067)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe issue only really affects the semaphores created for presentation, which are used to synchronize the command buffer with the presentation event. Apparently, the Vulkan API is allowed to return the same image index in succession, which meant the current implementation can run into trouble and start cycling through the semaphores.\r\n\r\nThe PR implements the suggestion \"a)\" from the validation error.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106407/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106407/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}